The objectives in csa.txt were created by first reading through the CED
hierarchy and hand writing (see scans/) learning objectives of various levels of
detail based on the CED and also on my experience teaching CSA. In CED terms my
learning objectives are more at the granularity of essential knowledge.

I then had Claude OCR the scanned notes (see ocr/). Then I had it label all of
my objectives with the best matching Unit/Topic/LO/EKs which gives us
objectives.tsv.